      "sha": "ebaf7b2df6c9ec65b363562039ae11afec6ff03a",
      "message": "Fix explainer lookup in project pages\n\nMove explainer file discovery into a dedicated utility so Astro getStaticPaths can import it safely without the top-level scope issue that broke deploys. This removes the duplicated recursive scan from [slug].astro and keeps matching custom explainers by file name regardless of category folder.\n\nThe change also renames the utility to expose a reusable `findExplainerAstroFiles` helper for consistent project explainer resolution across pages.",
